</style></div><section class="bg-gradient-white-50"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-medium"><div class="column centered-interior-hero"><div class="icon-wrapper is-red"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a08f162367a82658f69b97c_mats-founding.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-lg"/></div><div class="breadcrumb"><a data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b2f:2787e0d6-90fb-171f-8321-e5fdb62f1e82" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2787e0d6-90fb-171f-8321-e5fdb62f1e82" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22af824266-0449-ff73-3176-f037d61e3bf6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b2f%22%7D%5D" href="/program/autumn-2026" class="text-link-decoration has-padding">Program</a><div class="icon-xs t-c-gray300 w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b2f:af824266-0449-ff73-3176-f037d61e3bf7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="af824266-0449-ff73-3176-f037d61e3bf7" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22af824266-0449-ff73-3176-f037d61e3bf6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b2f%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration has-padding w--current">Founding and Field-Building</a></div><h1 class="heading-xlarge text-align-center">Founding and Field-Building</h1><div class="rtf-default w-richtext"><p>This track is for prospective <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/yw9B5jQazBKGLjize/ai-safety-undervalues-founders" data-wf-native-id-path="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d116d" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d116d">founders</a>, <a href="https://80000hours.org/career-reviews/ai-safety-fieldbuilding/" data-wf-native-id-path="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1170" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1170">field-builders</a>, high-agency <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/QCrT2DTJNfvuqtppB/ai-safety-s-biggest-talent-gap-isn-t-researchers-it-s" data-wf-native-id-path="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1173" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1173">generalists</a>, and <a href="https://nanransohoff.substack.com/p/there-should-be-general-managers" data-wf-native-id-path="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1176" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="05f830ba-96d8-2c8b-d072-f16c226d1176">general managers</a> who want to launch new AI safety initiatives. Over 12 weeks (with a potential 6–12 month extension), fellows build and launch something new with weekly guidance from mentors (founders, field-builders, sitting CEOs, program directors, etc.) who have done it themselves.</p></div><div class="button-wrapper tablet-center"></div></div></div></div></section><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-vertical padding-medium"><div class="_2x-grid _30-70"><div><div class="is-sticky"><div class="w-embed"><h2 class="heading-medium">
Application process
</h2></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"></div></div></div><div><div class="rtf-default w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Stage 1: Complete the general application, including track-specific short-response questions</li><li>Stage 2: Stream selection questions alongside possibly reference requests</li><li>Stage 3: Interviews and work-tests</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div><div class="padding-vertical padding-medium"><div class="hr-200"></div></div></div><div class="_2x-grid _30-70"><div><div class="is-sticky"><div class="w-embed"><h2 class="heading-medium">
Founding and Field-Building track overview
</h2></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div><div class="rtf-default w-richtext"><p>We think AI safety needs to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hd35o-XowKQ" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f358" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f358">scale fast</a> to ensure AI development and deployment goes well. At MATS, we are proud to have trained 10 cohorts of top researchers, but high-impact organizations are increasingly bottlenecked by management and scaling. There are more promising ideas than there are “<a href="https://nanransohoff.substack.com/p/there-should-be-general-managers" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f35b" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f35b">general managers</a>” to champion them, and available funding and capital are <a href="https://thecounterfactual.substack.com/p/the-anthropic-ipo-is-coming-we-arent" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f35e" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f35e">outpacing the capacity for deployment</a>. We are launching the MATS Founding &amp; Field-Building track to solve these bottlenecks and scale AI safety.</p><p>We want fellows who are resourceful, principled, and motivated to do work that matters. There are three main pathways in this track:</p><ul role="list"><li>Founder: You are an experienced or fast-learning founder who wants to launch new AI safety initiatives in a high-talent, deep-research, mission-aligned environment. Our mentors have high-impact agendas in need of founders, or you can bring your own ideas.</li><li>Amplifier: You are a high-agency org-builder or generalist who wants to enter AI safety for impact at an existing org as they scale or expand their reach with new projects.</li><li>Field-Builder: You are a well-connected, high-context generalist who wants to own talent development and deployment initiatives within AI safety.</li></ul><p>If you see yourself in any of these roles, we want you to apply!</p><p>Potential project inspiration from: <a href="https://coefficientgiving.org/tais-rfp-research-areas/" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f374" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f374">Coefficient Giving 2025 Technical AI Safety RFP</a>, <a href="https://bioactionplan.org/" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f377" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f377">Bio Action Plan</a>, <a href="https://www.forethought.org/research/ai-tools-for-existential-security" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f37a" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f37a">Lizka Vaintrob &amp; Owen Cotton-Barratt</a>, <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/PcTLHamp236afJxxT/some-for-profit-ai-alignment-org-ideas" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f37d" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f37d">Eric Ho</a>, <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/iwfdwzJerpC7FqbZG/the-case-for-agi-safety-products" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f380" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f380">Marius Hobbhahn</a>, <a href="https://thirdthing.ai/p/ten-ai-safety-projects-id-like-people" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f383" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f383">Julian Hazell</a>, <a href="https://www.heronsec.ai/post/the-ai-infrastructure-security-shortlist" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f386" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f386">Abbey Chaver</a>, and <a href="https://forum.effectivealtruism.org/posts/rAqKSSXankvys2Fzu/the-case-for-ai-safety-capacity-building-work#What_s_good_to_do_now_" data-wf-native-id-path="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f389" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b1eddfbd-7c38-61e1-ddbd-f3ed5780f389">Asya Bergal</a>.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="padding-vertical padding-large"><div class="hr-200"></div></div></div><div class="_2x-grid _30-70"><div><div class="is-sticky"><div class="w-embed"><h2 class="heading-medium">
Founding and Field-Building track streams
</h2></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div><div class="w-form"><form id="wf-form-program-stream-filter" name="wf-form-program-stream-filter" data-name="program-stream-filter" method="get" fs-list-element="filters" class="sidebar-search-form" data-wf-page-id="692f5d6b89bc3e9248bdb654" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d99b"><input class="form-input is-search w-input" fs-list-highlight="true" maxlength="256" fs-list-field="*" name="Search" data-name="Search" placeholder="Search: " fs-list-debounce="250" type="text" id="Search" fs-list-showquery="true"/><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown-wrapper w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d99e" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d99e" class="form-input dropdown-button-form filter-open w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Filters</div><div class="dropdown-arrow w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M4 6L8 10L12 6" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div></form><div class="hide w-form-done"></div><div class="hide w-form-fail"></div></div></div></div><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div fs-list-load="more" fs-list-element="list" role="list" class="column gap-md w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-0-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a97cade0946fa8f458a65fe%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a9554558b8aafb8dda822b2%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/alex-holness-tofts" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a9554558b8aafb8dda82297_headshotaht.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a97cade0946fa8f458a65fe%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/holness-tofts" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Alex Holness-Tofts (Resolution)</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-0-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a97cade0946fa8f458a65fe%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>This stream will focus on field-building and research amplification, including headhunting and talent projects, ecosystem incentives such as large impact bounties, and operational work to scale an alignment research team.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a97cade0946fa8f458a65fe%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/holness-tofts">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-0:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a97cade0946fa8f458a65fe%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Strong motivation to reduce loss-of-control risks from misaligned superintelligence.</p><p><strong>One</strong>&nbsp;of the following:</p><p>1. Impressive experience outside AI safety, for example: successfully scaling a startup as an early hire, 5 years at a top consultancy with above-average progression, or an unusually strong background from a leading tech company.</p><p>2. A strong AI safety operational track record, like leading a research fellowship, or talent program.</p><p><a href="https://coefficientgiving.org/research/reasoning-transparency/">Reasoning transparency.</a></p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-1-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404d9c6260d17959613ff%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/erwan" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a0404d9c6260d179596139e_1698950547814.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/erwan" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Dewi Erwan (BlueDot Impact)</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-1-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>Founding ambitious AI safety and field-building projects.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/erwan">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de_instance-1:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Mentorship structure</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Minimum support = 2x 30-min meetings per week. We could scale this up as appropriate.</p><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p>I&apos;ll be based in SF. If the fellows want to work in BlueDot&apos;s office for some periods of time, I could collaborate with them daily.</p><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p>I&apos;m available for quick calls anytime, and am responsive on Slack.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-1:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>I&apos;m open to people with a wide range of backgrounds. Though you need to be willing to work very hard, be great at communicating, and have a burning desire to make AI go well.</p><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p>I work best with people who are intense, communicate and reason clearly, and are mission-driven.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3_instance-1:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd470%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Project selection process</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>We&apos;ll work together to design the project. You&apos;ll have a lot of freedom to figure out what the best shape of thing to do is, and I&apos;ll provide lots of regular feedback and make relevant introductions to help you refine the proposal.</p><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p>Your first 1-2 weeks will be focused on figuring out what to do, and the rest of the fellowship will be focused on execution.</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-2-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83ee2d3d2853e3bf94eaab%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/fitz" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a83ee2c3d2853e3bf94ea4b_image.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-2-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83ee3174405b68ae02ec99%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/bohm" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a83ee3074405b68ae02ec57_GriffHeadshot.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-2-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa5b0cdacdd2dbf1bb18155%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/esben-kran" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6aa5b0cdacdd2dbf1bb1814d_6mCcOaQ1.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/juniper" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Juniper Ventures</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-2-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>This stream focuses on building companies in AI assurance infrastructure, from energy and physical networking to authentication and interpretability.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/juniper">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-2:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Strong candidates range from successful empirical ML researchers, who want to take their research into the real world, to people with a founding engineering or security background.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3_instance-2:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a8421f6378526a22ddbe91c%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Project selection process</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Scholars either propose a project or shape one with us from a shortlist of open problems drawn from what we see across the assurance landscape. We scope the work together early to achieve the most progress during the program.</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-3-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%22693dc45dc01b80d6f44801b0%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/gentzel" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a0405103635db62711093e3_Longview_Previews_0061.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/gentzel" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Matthew Gentzel</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-3-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248ca%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/policy-and-governance" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Policy and Governance</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-3-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248ce%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/strategy-and-forecasting" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Strategy and Forecasting</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-3-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>My stream aims to prevent catastrophic outcomes through the AI transition by focusing on three lines of effort: nuclear and AI-enabled strategic threats; cognitive security, information competition, and AI-enabled influence; and moral game theory, competitive strategy, and peace. Fellows can pursue their own research, help build the field, or support grantmaking in any of these areas.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/gentzel">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de_instance-3:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Mentorship structure</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Mentorship will mostly consist of calls, sorting through research ideas and providing feedback. I&apos;ll be up to review papers, and potentially to meet in person depending on timing.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-3:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><ul><li><strong>Sufficient domain knowledge.</strong>&nbsp;You should already know the basics of your proposed topic areas, or have a rough sense of your approach for topics that are very new.</li><li><strong>Intellectually curious and honest.</strong>&nbsp;Topics that relate to conflict are contentious and often result in many blind spots and biases, due to factors such as political psychology and deception. I am looking for thoughtful mentees that proactively search for ways they could be wrong, rather than updating passively.</li><li><strong>Clear reasoning, writing, and editing.</strong>&nbsp;You should be good at conveying ideas efficiently to normal people. If you use AI to augment your writing, the result should still clearly reflect your voice and thought.</li><li><strong>Self-management.</strong>&nbsp;While I will be providing feedback each week, you should be able to run an open-ended project with minimal supervision and make independent decisions on which lines of analysis to pursue.</li><li><strong>Aligned motivation.</strong>&nbsp;An ideal candidate will be directly interested in one or more of the topics in the work stream, rather than applying to pivot to a topic that falls far outside of the proposed work areas.</li></ul><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3_instance-3:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f093b1474bf35b439805%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Project selection process</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>I&apos;ll talk through project ideas with the scholar, or the scholar can pick from a list of projects</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-4-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa6f1f403fdb721de86ddb7%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa6f1f16e8a0db9919b7ad8%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/oliver-habryka" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6aa6f1f16e8a0db9919b7ad3_image.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa6f1f403fdb721de86ddb7%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/habryka" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Oliver Habryka</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-4-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa6f1f403fdb721de86ddb7%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>This stream works on infrastructure for AI safety research: AI tools that give safety researchers uplift, mechanism design and product development for funder coordination, and AI policy scenarios and proposals.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa6f1f403fdb721de86ddb7%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/habryka">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-5-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0405495c247053b6eac9be%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/campbell" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a0405495c247053b6eac98a_3dc085454ecda1cb44812c4730ed8739dd0c218d-3072x3074.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/campbell" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Rosie Campbell (Eleos)</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-5-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>Eleos AI Research is a nonprofit working to ensure the interests of AI systems are appropriately taken into account as we navigate transformative AI. We are looking for competent generalists to help scale up our AI welfare field-building by running high-impact events, or to otherwise amplify our research, communications, and operational capacity.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/campbell">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de_instance-5:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Mentorship structure</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>By default, I expect to meet with each fellow for at least 60 minutes per week (possibly split into 2 x 30 minute meetings). For projects that require a lot of input (e.g. event organizing), we can scale that up as needed. I&rsquo;ll also be available for ad hoc meetings, and can be reached asynchronously on Slack or by email. At Eleos, we each post a daily update in Slack; I would like fellows to do the same.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-5:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>The ideal candidate:</p><ul><li>Has experience managing projects or events</li><li>Has excellent written and verbal communication skills</li><li>Is conscientious and detail-oriented</li><li>Can navigate multiple stakeholders with different interests and incentives</li><li>Knows when to take initiative and solve problems independently, and when to seek help and input</li><li>Is familiar with the field of AI welfare</li></ul><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3_instance-5:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a849e01616a2b3b541a52b1%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Project selection process</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>We&apos;ll meet at the start of the program to discuss ideas in the areas listed above, as well as ideas that fellows would like to pitch. We&rsquo;ll jointly decide on a project that aligns with Eleos&rsquo;s priorities as well as the goals and skills of the fellow.</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-6-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a737c6bc936f796f4360c02%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/matican" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a737c6bc936f796f4360bfe_image.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-6-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0405495c247053b6eac9c6%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/mccormick" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a0405495c247053b6eac97e_image16.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/halcyon" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Ross Matican &amp; Mike McCormick (Halcyon Futures)</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-6-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-6-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248cc%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/systems-security" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Systems Security</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>Backing projects focused on product development and organization building in the areas of AI safety and alignment, biosecurity, and critical cybersecurity. Looking for fellows who are self starters, default to action, and have a desire to create.</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/halcyon">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de_instance-6:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9de%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Mentorship structure</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Co-mentorship from Halcyon&apos;s Ross Matican (Investor &amp; Grantmaker), Mike McCormick (Founder, CEO), and Charlie Petty (Venture Partner). Ross will be leading point.</p><p>Scheduled 45 min bi-weekly meetings (every other week). Ad hoc meetings can be added between scheduled sessions. We&apos;ll have a shared Slack channel with Ross, Mike, and Charlie, as well as the supporting team at Halcyon. Ping us anytime.</p></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-6:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p><strong>For product development and organization building projects:</strong></p><ul><li>Strong technical hardskills (e.g., MLE, SWE, math)</li><li>Domain expertise in AI safety and alignment, biosecurity, or cybersecurity</li><li>Experience with building or working on a usable product</li><li>Openness to iterating, pivoting, and failure</li><li>General understanding of business and organization principles</li><li>Considerate and works well in team settings</li></ul><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p><strong>For generalist projects:</strong></p><ul><li>5+ years of relevant experience: recruiting, talent / HR, executive search, or general business operations with a strong people component</li><li>Familiarity with the broader startup / early-stage ecosystem</li><li>A major plus would be familiarity with at least one of Halcyon&apos;s focus sectors (AI safety / frontier AI, biosecurity, cybersecurity): enough to read profiles credibly and have substantive conversations with portfolio companies</li><li>Strong organizational instincts</li><li>Excellent written and verbal communication</li><li>Experience working with CRM technologies as well as basic AI tools: Claude Cowork or similar</li></ul></div></nav></div></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3_instance-6:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a83f060964c495e6bcdd472%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e3%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Project selection process</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>For product development and organization building projects in the areas of AI safety and alignment, biosecurity, and critical cybersecurity - fellows will have full freedom. We expect fellows to come with rough ideas and opinions on direction that will inform where they start exploring the market. We don&rsquo;t expect refined ideas or pitches. We do expect building.</p><p class="whalesync-empty-line">&#8203;</p><p>For field building and generalist fellows, we are prioritizing a talent matching project. This includes processing thousands of individuals in our CRM, and finding how they may pair with our portfolio companies and other areas of high priority in our network.</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="column gap-sm w-dyn-item"><div class="row"><div class="indent w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-0 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="neg-indent w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5_instance-7-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9c5" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f56d83e2d628a9fd66514%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a040545a3e1e45c6cc72f3b%22%7D%5D" href="/mentor/turan" class="person-in-card w-inline-block"><div class="headshot-wrapper has-white-border is-small"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca73/6a040544a3e1e45c6cc72ec2_deger_photo_headshot.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-cover"/></div></a></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9cb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/turan" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><h4 fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="name" class="text-size-large text-weight-medium">Vehbi Deger Turan (Metaculus)</h4></a></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="row gap-inline-text w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-7-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248c8%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/founding-and-field-building" aria-current="page" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block w--current"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Founding and Field-Building</div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="list-with-comma w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1_instance-7-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d1" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%2C%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f5d6a89bc3e9248bdb5dc%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a0404252c6d185134e248ce%22%7D%5D" href="/tracks/strategy-and-forecasting" class="text-link-decoration w-inline-block"><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="group">Strategy and Forecasting</div></a></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div fs-list-highlight="true" fs-list-field="description" class="clamp-3lines w-richtext"><p>This stream focuses on forecasting, real world applications of world modeling with LLMs, formal &amp; semiformal verification, capability evaluations design, coordination mechanisms, collective intelligence applications, and gradual disempowerment.&nbsp;</p></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9d9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%5D" href="/stream/turan">Read more</a></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="4ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0_instance-7:e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b69" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22692f6909240230d18ff1dbf4%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa4991d2b52be55fb164ba2%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f98284-f358-445d-11b4-9f4b8b3c8b68%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224ce6b7ac-72a4-6916-846e-eff1ede0d9e0%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle is-small w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Desired fellow characteristics</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div faq-arrow="" class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><p>Interest in moving from theory to applied work, especially on coordination, negotiation and forecasting. If there are any resources that Metaculus and/or AI Objectives Institute can provide with real world applications that would be a great fit. Formal verification and specification knowledge would be a great match but not required. I am not personally interested in pursuing paper publications, but if the fellow is interested in this, I am happy to support them.</p></div></nav></div></div><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div></div><div role="navigation" aria-label="List" class="w-pagination-wrapper margin-top margin-small"></div></div></div></div><div><div class="is-sticky"><div class="padding-xsmall"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="padding-global bg-c-gray50"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xlarge"><section><div class="_2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc917026c-f63dc4a6"><div class="is-sticky"><h3 data-w-id="a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc917026e" class="heading-medium tablet-center">Frequently asked questions</h3></div></div><div><div class="hr-200"></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170271:6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%226fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170271%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question">What is the MATS Program?</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>The MATS Program is a 10-week research fellowship designed to train and support emerging researchers working on AI alignment, transparency and security. Fellows collaborate with world-class mentors, receive dedicated research management support, and join a vibrant community in Berkeley focused on advancing safe and reliable AI. The program provides the structure, resources, and mentorship needed to produce impactful research and launch long-term careers in AI safety.</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170278:6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%226fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170278%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question">Who are the MATS Mentors?</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>MATS mentors are leading researchers from a broad range of AI safety, alignment, governance, field-building and security domains. They include academics, industry researchers, and independent experts who guide scholars through research projects, provide feedback, and help shape each scholar’s growth as a researcher. The mentors represent expertise in areas such as:</p><ul role="list"><li>Agent foundations and decision theory</li><li>Control &amp; monitoring of AI systems</li><li>Mechanistic and concept-level interpretability</li><li>Capability evaluations and benchmarking</li><li>Cybersecurity, adversarial robustness, and safeguards</li><li>Forecasting, game theory, and national/international governance</li><li>Threat modeling, compliance verification, and compute proliferation</li><li>Model organisms, red-teaming, and deceptive alignment</li><li>Hardware interventions and information security</li></ul><p>View <a href="/mentors" data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:520fe03a-bef8-56ca-82d8-c5a18c1a4a29" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="520fe03a-bef8-56ca-82d8-c5a18c1a4a29" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%5D">past and current mentors</a></p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170272:6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%226fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170272%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question">What are the key dates of the MATS Program?</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p><strong>Key dates</strong></p><p>Application:</p><ul role="list"><li>General application period (May 12th to June 7th)</li><li>Additional evaluation (June 7th through late July)</li><li>Final offers (late July/early August)</li></ul><p>The main program will then run from September 28th to December 4th, with the extension phase for accepted fellows beginning in December. </p><p>‍</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170276:6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%226fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170276%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question">Who is eligible to apply?</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>MATS accepts applicants from diverse academic and professional backgrounds - from machine learning, mathematics, and computer science to policy, economics, physics, cognitive science, biology, and public health, as well as founders, operators, and field-builders without traditional research backgrounds. The primary requirements are strong motivation to contribute to AI safety and evidence of technical aptitude, research potential, or relevant operational experience. Prior AI safety experience is helpful but not required.</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40" class="faq-dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170277:6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="6fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a41" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%226fa48b1c-3061-472b-6fe9-e495199b2a40%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22a75f2990-ab12-5724-6a41-badfc9170277%22%7D%5D" class="faq-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question">How does the application and mentor selection process work?</div><div class="faq-dropdown-arrow"><div class="icon-xs w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.5 17L14.5 12L9.5 7" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>Applicants submit a general application, applying to various <a href="https://matsprogram.org/#:~:text=focuses on these-,tracks,-:" data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:c4974830-6405-d429-4dfa-129eca7e6bfa" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c4974830-6405-d429-4dfa-129eca7e6bfa" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%5D">tracks</a> (Empirical, Theory, Strategy &amp; Forecasting, Policy &amp; Governance, Systems Security, Biosecurity, Founding &amp; Field-Building.</p><p>In stage 2, applicants apply to <a href="https://matsprogram.org/program/summer-2026#:~:text=4.%20Post%2Dprogram-,Summer%202026%20Streams,-Technical%20Governance" data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:f6b8fa36-b99e-d0d7-7130-cad9192276fa" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f6b8fa36-b99e-d0d7-7130-cad9192276fa" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%5D">streams</a> within those tracks as well as completing track specific evaluations. </p><p>After a centralized review period, applicants who are advanced will then undergo additional evaluations depending on the preferences of the streams they&#x27;ve applied to before doing final interviews and receiving offers. </p><p>For more information on how to get into MATS, please look at <a href="/faq/getting-into-mats" data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99:e05e3021-be4e-4093-dfae-cd53d5012bcb" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e05e3021-be4e-4093-dfae-cd53d5012bcb" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2213d99aa6-86e2-008e-4f09-bc6ff63dc4a6%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b99%22%7D%5D">this</a> page. </p></div></nav></div></div></div></section></div></div></div><footer class="footer_component"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="_2x-grid tablet-stack portrait-center"><div id="w-node-_4547113c-b360-f161-70ae-68df1a72183a-a9cbb1f2"><a data-wf-native-id-path="8894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b9a:d6ddae30-0e25-0c13-0373-12aa3e15346d" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="d6ddae30-0e25-0c13-0373-12aa3e15346d" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%222a0ec840-01c7-44e5-3e46-bc8fa9cbb1f2%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%228894dd9e-cf7e-bf99-86b2-b1fff39f4b9a%22%7D%5D" href="/" class="navigation-logo-container neg-indent w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6909901117f6b8d83783ca29/690fa04b177bfbd9648c6961_2b9d64036e208f71551b26e0108a7d6e_MATS%20Logo%20KO.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="navigation-logo"/></a></div><div class="max-width-large max-width-full-tablet"><p class="text-size-small text-weight-light">The MATS Program seeks individuals who are deeply motivated by AI alignment, transparency, and security, and who are equipped with the skills and mindset to contribute to cutting-edge research. Sign-up below to get updates from our newsletter. </p><div><div class="padding-vertical padding-small"><div class="hr-200"></div></div></div><div class="margin-0 w-form"><form data-sync-base="appdokrjvVJ7mtLI4" method="post" name="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" data-name="Newsletter Form" action="https://potvcaut57.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/submit" id="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" data-sync-table="tblcdWdWX10S4qZA0" data-wf-page-id="692f5d6b89bc3e9248bdb654" data-wf-element-id="3978dfe6-4be2-e8f0-e3da-8613e18bad50"><div class="form-newsletter"><input class="form-input is-dark w-input" maxlength="256" name="Newsletter-Name" data-sync-field-name="Name" data-name="Newsletter-Name" placeholder="Name" type="text" 